Architecture: all
Version: 27.8.0
Replaces: palos-icons
Depends: palos-icons, python3, python3-pil, icoutils, dpkg
Description: palOS file icons and program thumbnails
 Document icons on palOS's parchment page, one emblem per kind of file
 (documents, text, spreadsheets, presentations, databases, layouts, PDFs, code,
 sound, video, fonts, paintings, pictures, TIFF), the blue zipper folder for
 archives, and program boxes: blue for Windows programs, brown for .deb packages,
 steel for AppImages. Windows programs and .deb packages that carry their own
 icon show it (with a Windows badge, or on the package box).
